妹妻真，生琨。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":34},{"id":"feipin-q-281a6eac2dcbd55f6f46","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-9ae53aa13f29da6d317d","layer":"original","quote":"尚卒，权为讨虏将军在吴〖7〗；聘以为妃，使母养子登〖8〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":44},{"id":"feipin-q-2ebcabf3ddae73773f72","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-2c19cedb8d2d9d632675","layer":"original","quote":"吴主权徐夫人，吴郡富春人也。祖父真，与权父坚相亲；坚以妹妻真，生琨。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"feipin-q-73c3d739359dffe70378","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-9ae53aa13f29da6d317d","layer":"original","quote":"琨生夫人，初适同郡陆尚","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11},{"id":"feipin-q-82a3b2d772f005de29cb","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-2c19cedb8d2d9d632675","layer":"original","quote":"吴主权徐夫人，吴郡富春人也。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"feipin-q-90688d3433872e330996","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-9ae53aa13f29da6d317d","layer":"original","quote":"权为吴王及即尊号，登为太子，群臣请立夫人为后；权意在步氏，卒不许。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":67,"end":100},{"id":"feipin-q-959bc97b94a55c0dca5a","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-9ae53aa13f29da6d317d","layer":"original","quote":"琨生夫人，初适同郡陆尚〖6〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15},{"id":"feipin-q-b4f048155260884e5cc3","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-9ae53aa13f29da6d317d","layer":"original","quote":"后权迁移〖9〗，以夫人妒忌，废处吴，积十余年。","